@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/chess-save-difficulty.puml
' purpose: Coach difficulty stays in its key; the Single Player modal
'          restores the last Adjutant script from its own key
' status: Coach elo shipped; StarChess modal restore is starchess_setup
' covers: apps/chess/src/store/settingsStore.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/store/newGameSetupStore.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/components/features/NewGamePanel.tsx
' live spec: _spec/apps/chess/entities.puml
'            _spec/apps/starchess/menu-flow.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' Coach ""difficulty"" (intermediate / advanced / expert) lives in
' ""chess_coach_settings_state"" via ""createPersistedStore"". The Single
' Player modal's Opponent select is naive|strategic in ""starchess_setup"".
' Do not write that script into ""settingsStore.difficulty"".
title Coach elo stays in its key;\nStarChess modal restores its script

component "settingsStore.difficulty" as PICK <<app>>
database "chess_coach_settings_state" as KEY <<db>>
component "StarChess opponent\nnaive | strategic" as OPP <<app>>
component "**in-memory only**" as MEM <<error>>
component "**a second difficulty enum**" as FORK <<error>>

PICK ARROW_MAIN KEY
KEY ARROW_MAIN PICK : restore on enter
MEM ARROW_ERROR KEY : shipped anti-goal
OPP ARROW_ERROR FORK : different product

note bottom of KEY
  **Refresh already restores the Coach
  picker.** Export of Coach games is
  ""gameShare.ts"", not this plan.
end note

note right of OPP
  **The Single Player modal reads
  ""starchess_setup"", not Coach
  difficulty.** A fresh open shows
  the last Adjutant script. The
  match URL still uses ""?opponent="".
end note

legend bottom
  **Coach elo stays in its key.**
  ==
  The Opponent select restores from
  ""starchess_setup"". Do not write
  naive|strategic into
  ""settingsStore.difficulty"".
end legend
@enduml
